  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Controlling malaria resurgence and reducing its  morbidity in Venezuela - Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic) (01-Jan-2021-31-Dec-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Venezuela (Bolivarian Republic), Malaria, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Venezuela)This program has the following goals: Disminuci&#xf3;n de la carga de enfermedad en 28% al a&#xf1;o 2023/Reduction in disease burden by 28% by 2023.  Disminucion del n&#xfa;mero de fallecidos por malaria en 41% al a&#xf1;o 2023/Reduction in the number of deaths from malaria by 41% per year 2023. The objectives of this program are: Promover una intervencion integral de control de la malaria en areas priorizas del pa&#xed;s con el objeto de reducir la carga de la enfermedad y la mortalidad/Promote a comprehensive malaria control intervention in priority areas of the country in order to reduce the burden of disease and mortality.  Proveer acceso temprano a diagn&#xf3;stico y tratamiento de la malaria a las poblaciones en los municipios con mayor transmisi&#xf3;n/Provide early access to malaria diagnosis and treatment to populations in the municipalities with the highest transmission.  Brindar protecci&#xf3;n contra la transmisi&#xf3;n de la malaria mediante el uso de mosquiteros impregnados por las comunidades m&#xe1;s afectadas/Provide protection against malaria transmission through the use of Long Lasting Insecticidal Nets by the most affected communities.  Ampliar la participaci&#xf3;n de las comunidades afectadas en las acciones de prevencion y control de la malaria/Expand the participation of affected communities in actions to prevent and control malaria</narrative>
  </description>
